#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.footer_copyright_company_name
msgid "Copyright ©"
msgstr ""

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave selecting the appropriate working schedule, the one from "
"your stay resources."
msgstr "ສ້າງການຢຸດພັກໃໝ່ ໂດຍເລືອກຕາຕະລາງເວລາເຮັດວຽກທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave the same way as previously, but this time specify the "
"resource this applies to."
msgstr "ສ້າງການຢຸດພັກໃໝ່ແບບດຽວກັບຄັ້ງກ່ອນ, ແຕ່ຄັ້ງນີ້ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຈະນໍາໃຊ້."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Created offers are assigned no company nor branch (default behavior).<br/>As "
"a result, they are available from all companies and branches, as well as all "
"websites from those."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກໍານົດໃຫ້ບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາໃດໜຶ່ງ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).<br/>ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈຶ່ງສາມາດນໍາໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກທຸກບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ທຸກສາຂາ ລວມທັງເວັບໄຊທັງໝົດຂອງບໍລິສັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Define start and end date time and save your leave."
msgstr "ກໍານົດວັນທີ-ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ ແລ້ວບັນທຶກການຢຸດພັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Deliver extra services"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການເສີມ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Odoo ໂດຍເຂົ້າໄປທີ່"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to\n"
"            improve your experience."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽນຮູ້ພື້ນຖານຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາທຸກຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ Odoo ມອບໃຫ້\n"
"            ເພື່ອຍົກລະດັບປະສົບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't be limited to those examples, you could have a gym area available to "
"members or a spa with massages!"
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າຍຶດຕິດສະເພາະຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຫ້ອງອອກກໍາລັງກາຍສໍາລັບສະມາຊິກ ຫຼື ສະປາ "
"ແລະ ການນວດໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to add resources available for payment at checkout from the POS "
"payment methods.<br/>Beware this is not possible when a POS session is open."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ພ້ອມສໍາລັບການຊໍາລະເງິນຕອນເຊັກເອົາ ຈາກວິທີການຊໍາລະເງິນຂອງ POS.<br/"
">ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮອບການຂາຍ POS ກໍາລັງເປີດຢູ່."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to replicate the Booking Blocker rule on all your pricelists "
"and to specify the website this applies to.<br/>On a regular basis postpone "
"this booking blocker start date season after season to unlock your calendar."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມນໍາໃຊ້ກົດລະບຽບປິດກັ້ນການຈອງ (Booking Blocker) ນີ້ໄປໃສ່ທຸກລາຍການລາຄາຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ "
"ລະບຸເວັບໄຊທີ່ຈະນໍາໃຊ້.<br/>ຄວນເລື່ອນວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການປິດກັ້ນການຈອງນີ້ອອກໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະລະດູການ "
"ເພື່ອເປີດປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ຈອງໄດ້."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Don't forget to save your setting changes."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Don't forget to send them their invoice!"
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມສົ່ງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Duplicate the sales tax that applies to your stay offer and rename the "
"duplicate to indicate that it applies locally, e.g. 15% (stay)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສໍາເນົາອາກອນຂາຍທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວປ່ຽນຊື່ສໍາເນົານັ້ນເພື່ອບົ່ງບອກວ່າໃຊ້ພາຍໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: 15% (ບ່ອນພັກ)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"During an available period, click, drag and drop on a pitch line to create a "
"slot."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ວ່າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງໃສ່ແຖວຈຸດຕັ້ງເຕັນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Each company can have its own website!"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດສາມາດມີເວັບໄຊເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Employee assignations"
msgstr "ການມອບໝາຍວຽກໃຫ້ພະນັກງານ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employee would open the tasks from their portal access and update the task "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"ພະນັກງານສາມາດເປີດວຽກງານຈາກລະບົບປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal) ຂອງພວກເຂົາ ແລະ "
"ອັບເດດສະຖານະວຽກງານໄດ້."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.view_page_home
msgid "End date"
msgstr ""

#. module: campsite
