#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing scarcity with availability"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຈໍານວນຈໍາກັດດ້ວຍການສະແດງຈໍານວນທີ່ວ່າງ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing your businesses"
msgstr "ການຈັດການທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.view_page_home
msgid "Map"
msgstr ""

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Monitoring performance"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມຜົນການດໍາເນີນງານ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Monitoring success with occupancy"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມຄວາມສໍາເລັດດ້ວຍອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that they relax, you can offer extra services to make your guests feel "
"even more\n"
"            comfortable!"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແຂກໄດ້ພັກຜ່ອນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະເໜີການບໍລິການເສີມຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຂກຂອງທ່ານຮູ້ສຶກ\n"
"            ສະດວກສະບາຍຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍສາຂາ, ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພະນັກງານບາງຄົນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະບາງສາຂາ "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ພວກເຂົາປະຕິບັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນປະຈໍາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂີດຈໍາກັດໃຫ້ແກ່ທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free\n"
"            to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test everything "
"around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນວ່າ ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີໃນແພັກເກດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດ\n"
"            ເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມສະບາຍ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a daily basis, house keeping tasks are created depending on the current "
"stays and assigned to employees that have house keeping shifts."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຕ່ລະວັນ, ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມການພັກເຊົາຕົວຈິງ ແລະ "
"ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານທີ່ມີຜຽນວຽກແມ່ບ້ານໃນມື້ນັ້ນ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "On a resource to block line, click, drag and drop to create a slot."
msgstr "ໃນແຖວຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປິດກັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "On the City Tax line, adjust the number of guest x nights delivered."
msgstr "ໃນແຖວອາກອນຕົວເມືອງ, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຈໍານວນ ແຂກ x ຄືນ ທີ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າພັກຕົວຈິງ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "On top of guest and stay management, you need to keep the place clean!"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການຈັດການແຂກ ແລະ ບ່ອນພັກແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຮັກສາສະຖານທີ່ໃຫ້ສະອາດຢູ່ສະເໝີ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the payment is done and the order booked seamlessly!"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ການຊໍາລະເງິນຈະສໍາເລັດ ແລະ ລາຍການຈອງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກທັນທີ!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once defined, you can switch between companies or branches from the company "
"selector at the top right of your screen.<br/>This will expose depending on "
"where you are, only the selected companies and branches data."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກໍານົດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາໄດ້ຈາກສ່ວນເລືອກບໍລິສັດຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."
"<br/>ລະບົບຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນຂອງບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done adding all the necessary pitches, click on a recently added slot "
"and then\n"
"                click the rental order link."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດຕັ້ງເຕັນທີ່ຈໍາເປັນທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງເວລາທີ່ຫາກໍເພີ່ມໃສ່ ແລ້ວ\n"
"                ຄລິກໃສ່ລິ້ງລາຍການສັ່ງເຊົ່າ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done, let's click, drag and drop on another pitch line to create a slot."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສໍາເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງໃສ່ແຖວຈຸດຕັ້ງເຕັນອື່ນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once done, logged in as a portal user."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສໍາເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຕູເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Portal)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once your guest order is all set after check out, create an invoice from "
"their order."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລາຍການຂອງແຂກຖືກຈັດການຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວຫຼັງຈາກເຊັກເອົາ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຈາກລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ນັ້ນ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open a stay offer page from the website and scroll down to the Customer "
"Reviews section."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກຈາກເວັບໄຊ ແລ້ວເລື່ອນລົງໄປຫາສ່ວນ ຄໍາຕິຊົມຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open now, the Tasks from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>This "
"is\n"
"                the daily list of house keeping tasks to be tackled."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດ ວຽກງານ ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກເຊົາ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>ນີ້ຄື\n"
"                ລາຍການວຽກແມ່ບ້ານປະຈໍາວັນທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the companies from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Settings)</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ບໍລິສັດ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; "
"ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the users from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Settings)</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຈາກເມນູ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ &amp; "
"ບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>Website App</strong> and navigate to the Stay Offers."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ (Website)</strong> ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ ຂໍ້ສະເໜີບ່ອນພັກ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Board from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>Here you "
"have an\n"
"                overview of the cleanness state of your resources."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ກະດານ ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກເຊົາ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>ຢູ່ນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ\n"
"                ພາບລວມສະຖານະຄວາມສະອາດຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Campsite App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບ Campsite ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ການກໍານົດຄ່າ / ການຢຸດພັກ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Campsite App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບ Campsite ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Campsite App to appreciate the currently planned bookings with the\n"
"                Schedule."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບ Campsite ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງແຜນການຈອງໃນປະຈຸບັນຜ່ານທາງ\n"
"                ຕາຕະລາງເວລາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Default pricelist from the configuration menu."
msgstr "ເປີດ ລາຍການລາຄາມາດຕະຖານ ຈາກເມນູການກໍານົດຄ່າ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr "ເປີດ ລາຍການລາຄາມາດຕະຖານ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງກົດລະບຽບລາຄາທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງຖືກນໍາໃຊ້ກັບມັນ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the POS App and select one of the register, the Bar for example."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບ POS ແລ້ວເລືອກເຄື່ອງບັນທຶກການຂາຍໃດໜຶ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ: ບາ (Bar)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ການວາງແຜນ ຈາກແອັບບ່ອນພັກເຊົາ, ເມນູ ວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ.<br/>\n"
"                ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຜຽນວຽກແມ່ບ້ານ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍວຽກໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານໄດ້."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Campsite App</strong>, Configuration / "
"Pricelists menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ລາຍການລາຄາ ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບ Campsite</strong>, ເມນູ ການກໍານົດຄ່າ / ລາຍການລາຄາ."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Settings App and navigate to the Rental section or search for "
"\"Unavailability days\"."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ໝວດ ການເຊົ່າ ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາຄໍາວ່າ \"Unavailability days\" (ວັນທີ່ບໍ່ວ່າງ)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ ການຊີ້ນໍາ (Steering) ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຄວາມພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (Availability)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ ການຊີ້ນໍາ (Steering) ແລ້ວເລືອກ ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ (Occupancy)."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
